If you want to find out what a wand is, nothing beats first engraving with
your fingers in the dust and thereafter with the unknown wand. If it is
make invisible, cancellation or teleportation you get a message like "The
engraving on the floor vanishes!" As far as I remember the only wands that
do not identify themselves in this manner are locking, opening, probing,
undead turning, and nothing of course.

